  "extract": "Kawai Strong Washburn is an American writer and novelist, best known for his debut novel Sharks in the Time of Saviors (2020) which won the Hemingway Foundation/PEN Award and the Minnesota Book Award in 2021.",
  "extract_html": "<p><b>Kawai Strong Washburn</b> is an American writer and novelist, best known for his debut novel <i>Sharks in the Time of Saviors</i> (2020) which won the Hemingway Foundation/PEN Award and the Minnesota Book Award in 2021.</p>"
